{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>小西灣有鹹水管爆裂，導致小西灣道路陷。路陷面積橫跨兩條行車線，工程人員緊急搶修。</p><p></p><p>現場是小西灣道18號、近富景花園，早上近七時半有地下鹹水管爆裂，導致附近兩個屋苑停鹹水。水務署隨即派員閂水掣。受事故影響，小西灣道西行道路封閉，途經巴士要改道。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:35:01.650960+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T05:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T06:28:21.434428+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:28:21.434428+00:00","content_hash":"7f87131219cdfb25ed9f33db0115f7866c47c46f23319803510ca5918a0d7b1e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}